{"id":"655308","name":"红豆沙酒酿小圆子","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/655308/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红豆","amount":"半碗"},{"name":"酒酿","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"小圆子","amount":"10颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"1把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红豆泡水一夜，后来才知道，这是赤小豆，不是红小豆，要用红小豆。","img":"images/655308/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"小豆煮水，加入冰糖。","img":"images/655308/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮好的小豆打成豆沙。","img":"images/655308/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热水下入小圆子。","img":"images/655308/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆沙加入酒酿。","img":"images/655308/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小圆子煮熟捞出来，放入豆沙和酒酿糊里。","img":"images/655308/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/655308/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"非常好吃。","img":"images/655308/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}